<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>SweepLine</title>
<script src="/assets/theme.js?v=<?= filemtime(__DIR__ . '/assets/theme.js') ?>"></script>
<link href="https://unpkg.com/maplibre-gl@5.6.1/dist/maplibre-gl.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="/assets/app.css?v=<?= filemtime(__DIR__ . '/assets/app.css') ?>" rel="stylesheet">
<script defer src="https://unpkg.com/maplibre-gl@5.6.1/dist/maplibre-gl.js"></script><script defer src="/assets/account.js?v=<?= filemtime(__DIR__ . '/assets/account.js') ?>"></script><script defer src="/assets/app.js?v=<?= filemtime(__DIR__ . '/assets/app.js') ?>"></script></head>
<body><header><a class="brand" href="/">&#8605; <span>SweepLine <small>ROAD DISCOVERY</small></span></a><span class="region" id="coverage">LOCAL ROADS. OPEN POSSIBILITIES.</span><label class="theme-picker" for="theme">Theme<select id="theme" name="theme"><option value="adaptive" selected>Adaptive</option><option value="light">Light</option><option value="dark">Dark</option></select></label><div class="account-actions"><span id="account-name"></span><a id="favorites-open" href="/favorites" hidden>Favorites</a><a id="history-open" href="/history" hidden>History</a><a id="jobs-open" href="/manage" hidden>Manage</a><a id="admin-open" href="/users" hidden>Users</a><button id="sign-out" type="button" hidden>Sign out</button></div></header>
<section id="account-gate" class="account-gate">
<div class="account-card"><span class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO SWEEPLINE</span><h1 id="account-title">Sign in</h1><p id="account-intro">Loading your session…</p>
<form id="account-form" hidden><label>Username<input name="username" autocomplete="username" required maxlength="254"></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="72"></label><button type="submit" id="account-submit">Sign in</button></form><p id="account-status" role="status"></p><button type="button" id="account-retry" hidden>Retry connection</button></div></section>
<section id="admin-panel" class="admin-panel" hidden aria-label="SuperAdmin management">
<div class="admin-heading"><h2 id="admin-page-title">Users</h2><a class="page-back" href="/">Back to discovery</a></div><p>Manage web accounts here; background processing and storage settings are available on the Manage page. Linux service accounts are separate.</p>
<div class="admin-columns"><div id="admin-users"><h3>Users</h3><form id="create-user"><label>Username<input name="username" required minlength="3" maxlength="64" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.-]{2,63}" autocomplete="off"></label><label>Name<input name="name" required maxlength="100"></label><label>Email (optional)<input name="email" type="email" maxlength="254"></label><label>Initial password<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="12" maxlength="72" required></label><button type="submit">Create user</button></form><div id="user-list"></div></div>
<div id="admin-jobs"><h3>Background jobs</h3><section class="storage-card" aria-labelledby="storage-title"><h3 id="storage-title">System storage</h3><div class="storage-layout"><div id="storage-pie" class="storage-pie" role="img" aria-label="Storage usage" hidden></div><div><ul id="storage-legend" class="storage-legend"></ul><p id="storage-note" role="status">Loading storage usage…</p></div></div><form id="storage-settings"><label>Database storage budget (MiB)<input id="database-budget" name="database_budget_mb" type="number" min="512" max="1048576" step="1" required></label><p class="field-help">1024 MiB = 1 GiB. Raising this limit requeues jobs blocked by the budget. Lowering it never deletes existing data.</p><button id="storage-save" type="submit">Save storage limit</button><p id="storage-settings-status" role="status"></p></form></section><p>Cancel queued or running work you no longer need. Areas are shared between searches; cancellation may affect other users. Running work stops at its next checkpoint. Existing active data is retained.</p><p id="job-counts"></p><p id="worker-status"></p><button id="admin-refresh" type="button">Refresh status</button><p>Active jobs appear first. Showing up to 100 preparation tasks and 100 manual imports.</p><div id="task-list"></div></div></div><p id="admin-status" role="status"></p></section>
<section id="history-panel" class="admin-panel" hidden aria-label="Previous searches"><div class="admin-heading"><h2>Previous searches</h2><a class="page-back" href="/">Back to discovery</a></div><p>Your latest 100 searches, newest first. Open a search to see current results on the map, or delete it from your history.</p><p id="history-status" role="status"></p><div id="history-list"></div></section>
<section id="favorites-panel" class="admin-panel" hidden aria-label="Favorite roads"><div class="admin-heading"><h2>Favorite roads</h2><a class="page-back" href="/">Back to discovery</a></div><p>Your saved road snapshots, including their original profile, metrics and search area. Open a road to view it on the map.</p><p id="favorites-status" role="status"></p><div id="favorites-list" class="favorites-list"></div></section>
<main id="workspace" hidden><aside><div class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">TAKE THE INTERESTING WAY</span><h1>Find your next<br>favorite road.</h1><p>Discover the curves, open stretches, and roads worth driving.</p></div>
<form id="search"><div class="pair"><div class="zip-field"><label for="zip-input">US ZIP code</label><div class="zip-picker"><input id="zip-input" name="zip" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{5}" maxlength="5" placeholder="5-digit ZIP" required autocomplete="postal-code"><button id="pick-zip" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Pick on map</button></div><p id="zip-pick-status" class="field-help" role="status"></p></div><label>Radius (miles)<input name="radius" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="1" max="50" step="1" value="5" required></label></div>
<label>YOUR DRIVING PROFILE<select name="profile" id="profile"><option value="twisty">Twisty Roads &middot; curves &amp; continuity</option><option value="open">Open Highways &middot; long &amp; uninterrupted</option></select></label>
<label for="min-length">Road longer than (miles) <span class="optional">Optional</span><input id="min-length" name="min_length" type="number" min="0" max="30" step="any" placeholder="No minimum" aria-describedby="length-help"></label><label for="max-length">Maximum road length (miles) <span class="optional">Optional</span><input id="max-length" name="max_length" type="number" min="0" max="150" step="any" placeholder="No maximum" aria-describedby="length-help"></label><p id="length-help" class="field-help">Leave either bound blank for no limit. Applies to the full continuous road stretch; the maximum is inclusive.</p>
<details><summary>Advanced filters</summary><label>Minimum curve density (1–10, Twisty Roads)<input name="min_curve_density_score" type="number" min="1" max="10" step="any" value="2.2" required aria-describedby="density-help"></label><p id="density-help" class="field-help">1 = no qualifying curves; 10 = maximum sampled curve density. Decimals allowed. Twisty filters do not affect Open Highways.</p><label>Minimum curvature quality (1–10)<input name="min_curvature_quality_score" type="number" min="1" max="10" step="any" value="2.08" required aria-describedby="quality-help"></label><p id="quality-help" class="field-help">1 = no qualifying curvature; 10 = strongest sustained curvature. Includes tight turns. Decimals allowed.</p><label>Minimum sustained curve length (feet)<input name="min_sustained_curve_ft" type="number" min="0" max="164042" step="any" value="150" required></label><label>Maximum mapped stops + uncertain controls<input name="max_stops" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100"></label><label>Road surface<select name="surface_filter"><option value="exclude_unpaved" selected>Allow unknown; exclude known unpaved</option><option value="known_paved">Confirmed paved only</option><option value="any">All surfaces</option></select></label></details>
<button type="submit" id="submit">Discover roads <span>&#8599;</span></button></form>
<details class="road-diagnostics"><summary>Missing a road? Check why</summary><form id="road-diagnostic"><label>Road name or route number<input name="road" placeholder="Road name or number" minlength="2" maxlength="100" required></label><p class="field-help">Checks the ZIP, radius and filters currently shown above against locally imported roads.</p><button id="diagnostic-submit" type="submit">Check this road</button></form><p id="diagnostic-status" role="status"></p><div id="diagnostic-results"></div></details>
<div id="search-feedback" class="search-feedback" data-busy="false" aria-busy="false"><div class="feedback-message"><span id="search-spinner" class="spinner" aria-hidden="true" hidden></span><p role="status" aria-live="polite" id="status">Choose a ZIP code to explore imported roads nearby.</p></div><progress id="search-progress" aria-label="Road preparation progress" hidden></progress><p id="search-progress-label" class="progress-label" hidden></p></div>
<div class="results-heading"><h2>Your discoveries</h2><span id="count">&mdash;</span></div><div id="results"></div>
<footer>Road characteristics for lawful driving. Mapped controls may be incomplete. Check access, closures, and conditions.<br>Road data &copy; <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap contributors</a> &middot; ZIP data <a href="https://www.geonames.org/">GeoNames</a></footer></aside>
<section class="map-wrap" aria-label="Road discovery map"><div id="map"></div><div id="map-pick-note" class="map-pick-note" hidden>Click a spot to find its nearest US ZIP center. Click “Cancel pick” to exit.</div><div class="map-tag"><span id="map-spinner" class="spinner" aria-hidden="true" hidden></span><span id="map-status">EXPLORE SOMETHING DIFFERENT</span></div><div class="legend"><span class="dot"></span>Road score <b>0</b><i></i><b>100</b></div><div id="road-detail" hidden></div></section></main></body></html>
